<https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/uncefact/iata-alignment> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "IATA ONE Record to UN/CEFACT code alignment" ;
    rdfs:comment "skos:exactMatch from IATA ONE Record code-list individuals to the UNECE codes they profile: 10 ModeCode -> Rec 19 (matched on the '(N)' code in rdfs:comment), 36 MeasurementUnitCode -> Rec 20 (matched on the local name). IATA codes with no UNECE counterpart, left unlinked: MeasurementUnitCode#KBQ, MeasurementUnitCode#MBQ, MeasurementUnitCode#NDA, MeasurementUnitCode#TBQ. Generated by scripts/generate_uncefact_iata_alignment.py; do not hand-edit." .

